bd6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d145009d999b4c68a50b6ab7d1a9073d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b94b1c1/uploads/origins/54e878b9-0723-4167-bba6-9ae90a326bd6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d82a26b4d3ce3b5730d1c62bcc85a338 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really like the more intense, stylized looks you give your pieces.\n\nDo you think you could draw a character of mine?\n\nShe is a monster hunter, she usually has a very serious expression.\n\nCould you draw her sharpening or cleaning a greatsword?\n\nIf visible, please give her leather gear with fur on it. Here are some examples: https://imgur.com/a/YUPq2lO\n\nIf my request requires too much design work or imagination, I understand! Thank you for the consideration either way!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Ha5auLz", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yomi_dokuhon/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d64adbd/uploads/origins/e14687e1-3dc3-4f84-9ede-37e5f5d5e02b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6adbf7748e2d1a0982581fa894690c73", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5d64adbd/uploads/origins/e14687e1-3dc3-4f84-9ede-37e5f5d5e02b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6adbf7748e2d1a0982581fa894690c73, https://si.imgix.net/5d64adbd/uploads/origins/e14687e1-3dc3-4f84-9ede-37e5f5d5e02b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e59ee6c0ca42b791fbc981211883b1e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5d64adbd/uploads/origins/e14687e1-3dc3-4f84-9ede-37e5f5d5e02b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3c3ee1d2e629430ce487f8afed89d46 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n私はあなたのスタイルが好きで、私のキャラクターをあなたに依頼したいのです!\n\nゴーストウルフで描いていただけませんか？ポーズや雰囲気は自由です。マスクは任意です。\nご検討よろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/u74xBUe", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"pa